@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:沢渡ココの死亡推定時刻……<br>つまりあの騒ぎの５分ほど前。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"私はそのとき<br><link=\"Objection_02_02_11_01\">ラウンジにいた</link>わ。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"そこには<br>蓮見レイアと夏目アンアンが<br><link=\"Objection_02_02_11_02\">いた</link>の。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"夏目アンアンと蓮見レイアは<br><link=\"Objection_02_02_11_03\">話に熱中していた</link>……<br>だから私に<br>気付かなかったのだと思う。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; IF 未通過 なし
@BeginIf Expression:Skip7_11_5flag1=false
    @GotoModified Path:.Judge7-11-2

; ELSE 通過済み・追加

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Open5,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ふたりは城ケ崎ノアの<br>絵についての話をしていた。<br>【シャワールームに<br>描かれた絵に<br>神秘性を感じる】<br>……そう言っていたわ。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"一言一句間違いない。<br>たしかにナノカくんは<br><link=\"Objection_02_02_11_04\">そこにいた</link>みたいだね。|#0202Trial11_Leia001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

# Judge7-11-2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Open5,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そのあと私は医務室にいたの。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Neutral_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"沢渡ココの死体が<br>発見されたあと、<br><link=\"Objection_02_02_11_05\">騒ぎになった</link>のには<br>気付いていたけど……。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"そこから<link=\"Objection_02_02_11_06\">少し遅れて</link><br>合流したわ。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

