@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……その間、<br>医務室で使えるものがないか<br>調べていたの。<br><link=\"Objection_02_02_11_07\">静かなものだった</link>わね。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

# Judge7-11-3

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Open4,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
